  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: Heritage & Planning Statement, September 2025 ; Existing Front and Rear Elevation, 0851, Revision 1; Existing Side Section and Roof Plan, 0851, Revision 1; Proposed Front and Rear Elevation, 0851, Revision 1; Proposed Roof Plan and Side Elevation, 0851, Revision 1; Kitchen Extract System Report, September 2025 ; Noise Impact Assessment Report, 12/08/2025, Revision No. 1.0.\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning. ",
    "Condition : 2 - Within one month of this decision all mitigation measures set out in the Noise Impact Assessment Report dated 12/08/2025 must be fully implemented. The kitchen extract, intake system, ducting and plant enclosure shall thereafter be retained and maintained in full accordance with the approved details. \r\n\r\nThe external noise level emitted from the kitchen extract, intake system and ductwork must at all times be at least 10dBA below the existing background noise level (or 15dBA where the noise has a tonal component), when assessed in accordance with BS4142:2014 at the nearest noise-sensitive premises.\r\n\r\nWithin two months of the installation, a post-installation noise assessment shall be submitted to the Council to confirm installation of the mitigation measures and compliance with these noise limits. \r\n\r\nReason: To ensure that the amenity of occupiers of the development site/ sur-rounding premises is not adversely affected by noise from mechanical installations/ equipment in accordance with the requirements of policies A1 and A4 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017.\r\n"
  ],
